Test:
```ts
it("META::SET_WINDOW_METADATA updates title/description/lang and clears", () => {
  const r = { ...renderer(), defaultTitle: "Default" };
  applyBatch(parseBatch(buildBatch([[CAT_META, CMD_SET_WINDOW_METADATA, 0, WINDOW_TITLE, 0, 0]], stringEntry("Library"))), r);
  expect(document.title).toBe("Library");
  applyBatch(... WINDOW_DESCRIPTION ... stringEntry("8 songs")));
  expect(meta content)...
  applyBatch(... WINDOW_LOCALE "da")
  expect(document.documentElement.lang).toBe("da");
  applyBatch(... WINDOW_TITLE ... stringEntry(""));
  expect(document.title).toBe("Default");
});
```
`stringEntry("")` returns 4 bytes length 0. `readString` returns "". Good.

Also test meta removed on empty description maybe.

